<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil CVRD maintained.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil CVRD maintained.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities said in a report it was maintaining its buy rating on recently privatized Brazilian mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD).</p>
<p>-- said the company reported better-than-expected earnings of $0.37 per ADR in the second quarter of 1997, above Nomura's estimates of $0.34 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- also said its 12-month target price is $30 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- Vale preferred stock was up 2.02 percent at 30.30 reais earlier on the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
